        "description": "Retrieve one page of addresses for one supplier. Optional narrowing through a caller-authored framework-v4 rowmatch filter; default selects all child IDs. Preserve count, limit, offset and hasMore. Empty items is valid; errors are not empty results. Continue at offset + count while hasMore is true.",
        "operationId": "getall_suppliers-addresses",
